        slider:
          MinLimit: 0
          MaxLimit: 1
          MinMaxValues: {x: 0.02515721, y: 0.9874213}
        time: 0
  - paragraph: The demon's laughter follows you, cold and mocking. "Remember this,
      mortal! You may outrun me now, but the perils ahead will drive you back into
      my GRASP. When you find yourself lost and desperate, my offer will still stand,
      and you will realize that your foolishness has only delayed the inevitable."
    action:
